Subject: [PATCH 5/7] atomics: switch to generated fallbacks
Date: Tue, 29 May 2018 19:07:44 +0100
Message-Id: <20180529180746.29684-6-mark.rutland@arm.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.11.0
In-Reply-To: <20180529180746.29684-1-mark.rutland@arm.com>
